sgx: add the SGX545 ISA trees and sgx-asm/sgx-disasm (-Dtools=sgx)

src/sgx/isa describes the PowerVR SGX545's USSE instruction set and
src/sgx/pds its PDS programs, both for isaspec; src/sgx/csbgen describes
its TA/3D state words for csbgen. -Dtools=sgx builds them, their tests,
and two tools, as -Dtools=etnaviv builds etnaviv-disasm: sgx-asm
assembles USSE instructions from text in one batch (for builds of the
GPU's microkernel firmware, which don't need a driver), and sgx-disasm
is the matching disassembler. 'all' includes sgx. The three trees are
clang-format clean and opt in to enforcement.

csbgen's generator is exported from src/imagination/csbgen as
pvr_gen_pack_header_py (as src/intel/genxml exports gen_pack_header_py),
and src/imagination, whose csbgen subdirectory is entered unconditionally,
is entered for -Dtools=sgx too.

